{
 "_about": "Training Camp in Team Deathmatch and Freeze Tag, every team from the Free for All points (the owner, 2026-11-22: \"all teams spawns everywhere randomly (there are no 'map sides')\"; \"not the same rules, the same spawn points that already exist\"). projects/v010b_cs_training_camp/day_teams, a copy of Free for All's day_8 as every row above leaves it (the fence's wall, its trucks, the burning campfires, no ammo crates): each of its 47 team-2 points (the owner's picks, ffa-training-camp-picks-1) is a point of team 0 and one of team 1 at its place and facing, ids 0-46 in each team; Team Deathmatch's own 12 + 12 (most at the gateways, outside the fence) take the first places, the others are made like them (Team Deathmatch's protection, radii and priority; the game's own choice of a team's free points), and the team-2 points go. Team Deathmatch's config (maps_dict 212, its row taken out by stalker-tdm-hold-1) plays day_teams and has its row again; Freeze Tag's, a copy of it as freeze-tag-1 makes Rudnya's (mode 12, ui.icon 4, its names, no ticket rule), is maps_dict 450. After artefact-hunt-1, whose rows count the dictionary, and the other team maps' lists (freeze-tag-maps-1, artefact-hunt-maps-1), whose rows follow its last (scripts/stalker-maps/make_training_teams.py, docs/notes/stalker-ffa.md).",
